# Partial-dump integration case (issue #193): one TEXT mesh, compared against a
# reference captured from a plain (no-dump) run with the same seed and nstat.

Geometry Mesh
   Name MyMesh
    X -5.0    5.0    1
    Y -5.0    5.0    1
    Z  0.0   20.0  200   # 1 mm steps

Output
         Filename NB_msh.dat
         Fileformat TEXT
         Geo MyMesh
         Quantity Energy
         Quantity Fluence
